//   - `PAUSED_BY_USER`: The robot is braking or in standstill due to a user request. The clock IS paused.
//   - `PAUSED_NEAR_JOINT_LIMIT`: The robot is braking due to a joint limit. The clock is NOT paused.
//   - `PAUSED_NEAR_COLLISION`: The robot is braking due to a collision. The clock is NOT paused.
//   - `PAUSED_NEAR_SINGULARITY`: The robot is braking due to a singularity. The clock is NOT paused.
//   - `PAUSED_NEAR_WORKSPACE_BOUNDARY`: The robot is braking due to a workspace boundary. The clock is NOT paused.
//
// Takes a body of the `application/json` content type, and returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
//
